# Exclusions of the mutation gate for the crate modellweg (gates.sh, gate mutants, reads every mutants/*.liste).
# Format and rules: mutants/README.md. One entry per line: <list> <kind> <pattern>.

# modellweg, `Ende::ablehnung`: mode 2 holds no key, so no way reaches `mw.leck_gesperrt` (unbound targets have none, bound ones lock at the holder).
gleichwertig re crates/modellweg/src/tunnel.rs:101:13: delete match arm "mw.leck_gesperrt" in Ende::ablehnung
# modellweg, `Tunnel::weiterreichen`: an unbound target never hands an upgrade through and never gets `umstellen`, so `umgestellt` is always false.
gleichwertig re crates/modellweg/src/tunnel.rs:373:38: replace == with != in Tunnel::weiterreichen
gleichwertig re crates/modellweg/src/tunnel.rs:373:45: replace && with [|][|] in Tunnel::weiterreichen
